{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01346",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 5.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.02,
      "end_seconds": 10.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.62,
      "end_seconds": 21.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "Doctor, it's sharp pain on the right side when I breathe in. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.81,
      "end_seconds": 25.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.09,
      "end_seconds": 31.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Erm, it's been going on for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.07,
      "end_seconds": 35.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.75,
      "end_seconds": 39.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Deep breaths definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.24,
      "end_seconds": 45.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Alright, has there been a cough with phlegm too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.36,
      "end_seconds": 61.49,
      "duration_seconds": 12.13,
      "text": "Yes, I have. With cough with phlegm, honestly, a few times a day. I've been feeling very weak too, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.68,
      "end_seconds": 67.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.32,
      "end_seconds": 78.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Yes, um, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.0,
      "end_seconds": 82.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.56,
      "end_seconds": 101.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "there's bronchial breathing and crackles at the right lower zone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.32,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Right, you can sit up now. Any recent travel, confusion or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.72,
      "end_seconds": 117.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.87,
      "end_seconds": 119.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Any sign of palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.28,
      "end_seconds": 123.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Not at all, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.4,
      "end_seconds": 126.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.33,
      "end_seconds": 130.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.8,
      "end_seconds": 134.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Right, anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.03,
      "end_seconds": 137.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.66,
      "end_seconds": 144.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.59,
      "end_seconds": 149.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.11,
      "end_seconds": 164.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.55,
      "end_seconds": 171.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I've had COPD for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.88,
      "end_seconds": 173.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.71,
      "end_seconds": 176.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.5,
      "end_seconds": 188.76,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "hm, okay. Okay, I can see COPD in your file as well. Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.66,
      "end_seconds": 195.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.59,
      "end_seconds": 196.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.34,
      "end_seconds": 206.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "I take ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning. I was on metoprolol before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 210.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.26,
      "end_seconds": 215.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.13,
      "end_seconds": 220.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.43,
      "end_seconds": 224.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.05,
      "end_seconds": 228.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.89,
      "end_seconds": 232.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.61,
      "end_seconds": 240.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards a possible pneumonia on the right side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.35,
      "end_seconds": 276.93,
      "duration_seconds": 17.58,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a sputum culture for pneumonia. I want a chest X-ray done, that's for suspected pneumonia. What I'm giving you is amoxicillin-clavulanate, 625 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. That's for chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.81,
      "end_seconds": 283.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.92,
      "end_seconds": 294.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "The treatment will be paracetamol, 500 milligrams, every six hours if needed, for three days. That That should help with fever and body aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.4,
      "end_seconds": 298.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.99,
      "end_seconds": 303.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Rest and fluids, and finish every dose of the antibiotic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.17,
      "end_seconds": 319.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.24,
      "text": "Ah. If it hasn't settled in two weeks, we'd think about blood tests, but not now. If the breathlessness worsens or you become drowsy, that's the point to come in urgently. We'll catch up after the X-ray."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.43,
      "end_seconds": 323.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.97,
      "end_seconds": 327.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.7,
      "end_seconds": 330.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}